# k3s-health-gate.sh pod allow-list.
#
# One extended regex per line, matched against "<namespace>/<pod-name> <reason>".
# Matching problem pods are reported as INFO instead of failing the gate.
# Keep this to known, pre-existing noise; anything new should fail the gate.

# argo-events controller restarts constantly (6,663 restarts at the 2026-10-04
# baseline); pre-existing and unrelated to the control plane.
^argo-events/argo-events-controller-manager-

# Failing codebase-brain Argo workflow pods (phase Failed, owned by Workflows).
^codebase-brain/brain-

# system-upgrade-controller upgrade jobs: the first pod is killed when k3s
# restarts and stays Failed until the job's TTL (900 s) removes it; the retry
# pod completes the job. Real job failures are caught by the suc.jobs check.
^system-upgrade/apply-(server|agent)-plan-
